    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A Centrally Located End of Terrace Residence, Offering An Exciting Opportunity to Reimagine\r\n\r\nNumber 9 Church Lane presents an exciting opportunity to acquire a well located 3 bed end-of-terrace residence offering enormous scope to create a charming home in the heart of New Ross. Extending to approximately 55sq.m., the property provides a genuine blank canvas for purchasers wishing to renovate and personalise. The existing accommodation comprises extends to c. 55sq m arranged over two levels. The is a compact rear yard with separate pedestrian access. Ideally positioned on Church Lane, between Mary Street and The Bullawn, the property enjoys a highly convenient town-centre location, with shops, cafés, schools and a host of everyday amenities all within easy walking distance. Number 9 Church Lane offers a rare opportunity to transform a centrally located property into a stylish home full of character. Early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch 1.7m x 1m\r\n\r\nLiving room 3m x 2.8m with fireplace \r\n\r\nKitchen 3.2m x 3m\r\n\r\nUtility (Shower room) 5.6m x 1.6m\r\n\r\nFirst floor\r\n\r\nOpen plan 5.8m x 4.5m\r\n  \t\t \t \r\nOUTSIDE:  Compact westerly facing rear yard \r\nSERVICES: All main services"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Currently Extending to c. 55sq m\r\nPrivate rear yard with separate pedestrian access\r\nQualifies for the Vacant Home Grant"
